# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Routing happens in the browser (frontend/src/App.tsx), so the host must serve
# index.html for any path it does not recognise as a file. Without this rule a
# patient opening their meeting link (/j/<token>) or review link
# (/review/<token>) straight from WhatsApp gets a 404 — the app would only work
# if you navigated from the home page first.
#
# 200 (not 301) so the URL in the address bar is preserved for the router.
/*    /index.html   200
